{"id":"10115bca0ef04fef","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-arithmetic-circuit.md","title":"Arithmetic Circuit","display":"df-arithmetic-circuit — Arithmetic Circuit","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-arithmetic-circuit","aliases":["28-df-arithmetic-circuit","Arithmetic Circuit"],"display":"df-arithmetic-circuit — Arithmetic Circuit","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §16.1.3; ordered-input-port variant","source_printed_pages":"322–323","source_pdf_pages":"348–349","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-arithmetic-circuit"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-arithmetic-circuit</span><span>Arithmetic Circuit</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetic-circuit — Arithmetic Circuit"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §16.1.3; ordered-input-port variant"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"322–323"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"348–349"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb F\">\\(\\mathbb F\\)</span> 为域，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb F[X_1,\\ldots,X_n]\">\\(\\mathbb F[X_1,\\ldots,X_n]\\)</span> 为多项式环。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=(N,o,\\tau,\\sigma)\">\\(C=(N,o,\\tau,\\sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(N\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，顶点编号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[N]\">\\([N]\\)</span> 是拓扑顺序；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o\\in[N]\">\\(o\\in[N]\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(v)\">\\(\\tau(v)\\)</span> 属于互不混淆的常量标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(0,a)\">\\((0,a)\\)</span>、变量标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(1,i)\">\\((1,i)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\">\\(+\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\times\">\\(\\times\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma(v)\">\\(\\sigma(v)\\)</span> 是前驱编号的有序对，允许重复编号。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>求值递归 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_v\">\\(p_v\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{poly}(C)\">\\(\\operatorname{poly}(C)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{asize}(C)\">\\(\\operatorname{asize}(C)\\)</span> 只对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathbf{ArithCirc}_{\\mathbb F,n}\">\\(C\\in\\mathbf{ArithCirc}_{\\mathbb F,n}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in[N]\">\\(v\\in[N]\\)</span> 定义。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{ArithCirc}_{\\mathbb F,n}\\coloneqq\\{(N,o,\\tau,\\sigma):\\;&amp;N\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1},\\ o\\in[N],\\ \\tau:[N]\\to(\\{0\\}\\times\\mathbb F)\\cup(\\{1\\}\\times[n])\\cup\\{+,\\times\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\sigma:\\{v\\in[N]:\\tau(v)\\in\\{+,\\times\\}\\}\\to[N]^2,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall v\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\ \\sigma(v)\\in[v-1]^2\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{ArithCirc}_{\\mathbb F,n}\\coloneqq\\{(N,o,\\tau,\\sigma):\\;&amp;N\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1},\\ o\\in[N],\\ \\tau:[N]\\to(\\{0\\}\\times\\mathbb F)\\cup(\\{1\\}\\times[n])\\cup\\{+,\\times\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\sigma:\\{v\\in[N]:\\tau(v)\\in\\{+,\\times\\}\\}\\to[N]^2,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall v\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\ \\sigma(v)\\in[v-1]^2\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p_v\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a&amp;\\tau(v)=(0,a),\\\\X_i&amp;\\tau(v)=(1,i),\\\\p_u+p_w&amp;\\tau(v)=+,\\ \\sigma(v)=(u,w),\\\\p_up_w&amp;\\tau(v)=\\times,\\ \\sigma(v)=(u,w).\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p_v\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a&amp;\\tau(v)=(0,a),\\\\X_i&amp;\\tau(v)=(1,i),\\\\p_u+p_w&amp;\\tau(v)=+,\\ \\sigma(v)=(u,w),\\\\p_up_w&amp;\\tau(v)=\\times,\\ \\sigma(v)=(u,w).\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{poly}(C)\\coloneqq p_o,\\qquad \\operatorname{asize}(C)\\coloneqq N\\quad(C\\in\\mathbf{ArithCirc}_{\\mathbb F,n}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{poly}(C)\\coloneqq p_o,\\qquad \\operatorname{asize}(C)\\coloneqq N\\quad(C\\in\\mathbf{ArithCirc}_{\\mathbb F,n}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>按顶点编号进行良基递归。门的两个输入端口可连向同一前驱，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_i^2\">\\(X_i^2\\)</span> 不会因集合型前驱丢失重数。无除法模型；算术规模用 asize 避免与布尔非输入门数混用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：§16.1.3; ordered-input-port variant，印刷页 322–323；PDF 页 348–349。已比对相应陈述。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>原书不允许平行边，计算平方时先加零复制；本条允许重复输入端口作为显式模型变体。asize 计所有顶点而原书规模计运算门，两种计量并非逐实例相等。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb F","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb F[X_1,\\ldots,X_n]","display":false},{"tex":"C=(N,o,\\tau,\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"N\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"[N]","display":false},{"tex":"o\\in[N]","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau(v)","display":false},{"tex":"(0,a)","display":false},{"tex":"(1,i)","display":false},{"tex":"+","display":false},{"tex":"\\times","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma(v)","display":false},{"tex":"p_v","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{poly}(C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{asize}(C)","display":false},{"tex":"C\\in\\mathbf{ArithCirc}_{\\mathbb F,n}","display":false},{"tex":"v\\in[N]","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{ArithCirc}_{\\mathbb F,n}\\coloneqq\\{(N,o,\\tau,\\sigma):\\;&N\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1},\\ o\\in[N],\\ \\tau:[N]\\to(\\{0\\}\\times\\mathbb F)\\cup(\\{1\\}\\times[n])\\cup\\{+,\\times\\},\\\\\n&\\sigma:\\{v\\in[N]:\\tau(v)\\in\\{+,\\times\\}\\}\\to[N]^2,\\\\\n&\\forall v\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\ \\sigma(v)\\in[v-1]^2\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"p_v\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a&\\tau(v)=(0,a),\\\\X_i&\\tau(v)=(1,i),\\\\p_u+p_w&\\tau(v)=+,\\ \\sigma(v)=(u,w),\\\\p_up_w&\\tau(v)=\\times,\\ \\sigma(v)=(u,w).\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{poly}(C)\\coloneqq p_o,\\qquad \\operatorname{asize}(C)\\coloneqq N\\quad(C\\in\\mathbf{ArithCirc}_{\\mathbb F,n}).","display":true},{"tex":"X_i^2","display":false}],"bytes":2256,"backlinks":[{"id":"0e8b07be9e1b2152","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；算术电路 $C=(N,o,\\tau,\\sigma)\\in\\mathbf{ArithCirc}_{\\mathbb Q,n}$、$\\operatorname{poly}(C)$、$\\operatorname{asize}(C)$ 见 [[28-df-arithmetic-circuit]]。$\\operatorname{bin}(j)$ 为自然数 $j$ 的无前导零二进制表示，$\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0$；邻接字串表示连接。下式构造整数前缀码、带符号整数码和电路门表码 $\\langle n,C\\rangle$；只有整数常量标签的电路属于编码域，非法编码不属于下式语言。$j\\in\\mathbb N$，$a\\in\\mathbb Z$；单比特串 $\\langle b\\rangle$ 对应比特 $b\\in\\{0,1\\}$。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-108","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"算术电路：[[28-df-arithmetic-circuit]]、[[28-thm-schwartz-zippel]]、[[28-thm-valiant-permanent]]。"},{"id":"c9ef13719785316e","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ZEROP}_{\\mathbb Z}$、$\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb Z,k}$、$\\operatorname{poly}$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-identity-testing]]；$\\operatorname{asize}$ 见 [[28-df-arithmetic-circuit]]。$\\mathbf P,\\mathbf{NEXP},\\mathbf{P/poly}$ 采用 [[28-df-p]]、[[28-df-nexp]]、[[28-df-p-poly]]。$S_n$ 为 $[n]$ 上所有排列；$X=(X_{ij})_{i,j\\in[n]}$ 为 n² 个形式变量。"},{"id":"8f4e7f4b6a171c26","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb F$ 为域，$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$d\\in\\mathbb N$，$C\\in\\mathbf{ArithCirc}_{\\mathbb F,n}$，$p=\\operatorname{poly}(C)$ 见 [[28-df-arithmetic-circuit]]。$S\\subseteq\\mathbb F$ 有限非空，$\\deg p\\le d$，其中 $\\deg0=-\\infty$，$X$ 在 $S^n$ 上均匀。"},{"id":"006e7cf553394a08","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p\\in\\mathbb F[x_1,\\ldots,x_n]\\setminus\\{0\\}$ (非零多项式, see [[28-df-arithmetic-circuit]])"}],"outgoing":[]}